I've moved the two fields into the font config object now. With the primary target being the line height customization, the resulting config might look something like this to the user:
```json
{
    "profiles":
    {
        "defaults":
        {
            "font":
            {
                "face": "Consolas",
                "size": 13,
                "cellHeight": "1.4"
            }
        }
    }
}
```
